OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn 'Britannia Shield'
OL,4,Aair defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to
OL,7,Finvest #10bn in a new missile and drone
OL,8,Fdefence system to defend the UK if they
OL,9,Fwon the next general election.
OL,11,FThe so-called "Britannia Shield" would
OL,12,Fprovide an integrated network of radar,
OL,13,Fcommand and control systems, as well as
OL,14,Finterceptor missiles, the party said.
OL,16,FIn a speech at the Conservative Party
OL,17,Fconference on Tuesday, shadow defence
OL,18,Fsecretary James Cartlidge will describe
OL,19,Fthe pledge as "the most significant
OL,20,Fupgrade to UK air defence for
OL,21,Fgenerations".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
